# Regression-test engine: 13 kN sea-level LOX/RP-1, non-scalar (station-wise)
# regen wall sizing, all component CAD exported as STL.
#
# Run from the repository root with:
#   PYTHONPATH=. python -m raosim @examples/cli/test_13kn_sealevel_regen_allstl.args
# (or `lrekit @examples/cli/test_13kn_sealevel_regen_allstl.args` when installed)
#
# Any later command-line flag overrides the value here, e.g. append
# `--max-nfev 4000 --out builds/tests/13kn_sl_full` for the deep solver check.
#
# Parameter provenance (see TEST_PROMPT.md and docs/REPO_PHYSICS_AUDIT_2026-07-02.md):
#   - LOX/RP-1 gamma/Mw/Tc/O-F from the built-in table anchored to Sutton &
#     Biblarz RPE 9th ed. Table 5-5 (raosim/propellants.py source note).
#   - Pc = 3.0 MPa: verified feasible for the station-wise GRCop-84 regen
#     sizing at this thrust class; Bartz throat heat flux scales ~Pc^0.8
#     (Bartz 1957, propulsion_texts/technical-notes-1957.pdf), and 7 MPa was
#     probed thermally infeasible for every catalog liner at 13 kN.
#   - Sea-level matched expansion Pe = Pa = 101325 Pa (optimum CF when
#     Pe = Pa, Sutton RPE; repo relation expansion_ratio_from_pressure):
#     epsilon = 4.524, pa/p0 = 101325/3.0e6 = 0.033775.
#   - GRCop-84 liner + Inconel 718 closeout per NASA GRCop chamber work
#     (propulsion_texts/gradl2016..2020.pdf); catalog T_max 1000 K, S_y 186 MPa.
#   - SP-125 station-wise liner stress screens (eqs 4-28/29/31/32, audited
#     2026-07-02); Hall Cd inversion for Ru/Rt via --cd-target 0.99.

--no-banner

# Operating point: 13 kN at sea level, matched expansion.
--propellant LOX/RP-1
--oxidizer LOX
--fuel RP-1
--pc 3.0e6
--target-thrust 13000
--epsilon 4.524
--pa-over-p0 0.033775
--length-pct 80

# Chamber and throat package.
--l-star 1.0
--contraction-ratio 3.0
--minimum-cylindrical-length 0.03
--cd-target 0.99

# Fast seed contour by default; override --max-nfev for the full JAX solve.
--max-nfev 0
--n-control 8
--n-kernel 12

# Non-scalar regen: station-wise hot-wall + channel thermostructural sizing
# (SP-125 screens), GRCop-84 liner with Inconel 718 closeout jacket.
--regen
--wall-sizing regen
--material grcop-84
--jacket-material inconel718
--channel-height 0.0025
--channel-height-steps 6
--helix-turns 1.0
--coolant rp1
--coolant-inlet-temperature 293
--cooling-fraction 1.0
--margin-target 1.05
--structural-fos 1.0
--required-cycles 25
--life-fos 1.0
--dp-budget 500
--t-hot-min 0.0006
--t-hot-max 0.003
--thermal

# Pintle injector and electric pump feed package.
--injector pintle
--electric-pump
--fuel-tank-pressure 500000
--oxidizer-tank-pressure 600000
--fuel-injector-dp-fraction 0.20
--oxidizer-injector-dp-fraction 0.20
--fuel-line-loss-fraction 0.02
--oxidizer-line-loss-fraction 0.02
--fuel-manifold-loss-fraction 0.02
--oxidizer-manifold-loss-fraction 0.02
--pump-max-rpm 120000
--burn-time 12

# All component CAD as STL. wall.stl / jacket.stl / regen.stl are always
# written; pintle part STLs need CadQuery (pip install cadquery); pump part
# STLs are native meshes gated watertight by default. No STEP requested.
--injector-cad parts
--injector-cad-format stl
--pump-cad parts
--pump-cad-format stl
--cad none

--out builds/tests/13kn_sl_fast
